    (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid f15f6c02-c068-5e3a-b389-102bc895d058)
  )
  (text "5. ESP32-DevKitC (38 pinos), MODULOS PCM1808 / PCM5102A (por cabinhos) E CONECTORES PARA FORA DA PLACA"
    (at 30 332 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 2bab871d-c107-53dc-aefa-5ffef97e9a2d)
  )
  (text "U1: Ampop dual rail-to-rail (MCP6022 ou TLC2272). A = buffer da guitarra; B = seguidor da referência (não pode ficar solto)"
    (at 262 90 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid d1720950-d346-5396-9d1c-54c2c0e36153)
  )
  (text "J1: ESP32-DevKitC 38 pinos, USB para baixo. Esquerda, de cima: 3V3 EN IO36 IO39 IO34 IO35 IO32 IO33 IO25 IO26 IO27 IO14 IO12 GND IO13 SD2 SD3 CMD 5V"
    (at 22 404 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 9d3b48be-1b96-5748-a9f9-74c267759290)
  )
  (text "J2: Direita, de cima: GND IO23 IO22 TXD0 RXD0 IO21 GND IO19 IO18 IO5 IO17 IO16 IO4 IO0 IO2 IO15 SD1 SD0 CLK"
    (at 80 408 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 48a0258f-d308-5a6e-bd18-ec87b16887d2)
  )
  (text "J3: Módulo ADC PCM1808: 5V, 3V3, GND, SCK(MCLK), BCK, LRCK, OUT, entrada L, GND da entrada"
    (at 170 392 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 0ba07f23-a19c-5bf2-baa5-78526a008a68)
  )
  (text "J4: Módulo DAC PCM5102A: VIN (5V ou 3V3, conforme o módulo), GND, BCK, LRCK, DIN, saída L, GND. SCK do módulo no GND."
    (at 250 398 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 3021b39f-ab00-5bfc-873f-3d7f66b6d47b)
  )

